WHY THIS IS NOT PERMISSIVELY LICENSED
-------------------------------------
This project automates authenticated sessions on job platforms whose terms of
service prohibit automated access. A permissive licence would amount to an
invitation for strangers to point it at those platforms under their own
accounts, and the consequences of that would land on the author's name and
this repository.

It is published to be READ, not deployed. If you want to run something like
it, write your own and take your own decision about those terms.

